2026-07-24 09:27. changed autostart.sh so that audio starts like this:
pipewire && wireplumber && pipewire-pulse &
- this works and gets rid of the "dummy output" problem
- it's better to do it this way; think how wireplumber can't start until pipewire has successfully completed


